@DigitalArs.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5179
@token = 

### Login admin (copiar token a @token)
POST {{DigitalArs.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@digitalars.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Listar usuarios (paginado)
GET {{DigitalArs.API_HostAddress}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar usuarios con filtros
GET {{DigitalArs.API_HostAddress}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=10&name=Juan&email=juan&roleId=2&isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle de usuario
GET {{DigitalArs.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear usuario + cuenta
POST {{DigitalArs.API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nuevo Usuario",
  "email": "nuevo.usuario@digitalars.com",
  "password": "User123!",
  "dni": "40111222",
  "alias": "nuevo.usuario",
  "roleId": 2
}

### Actualizar usuario
PUT {{DigitalArs.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Juan Perez",
  "email": "juan.perez@digitalars.com",
  "dni": "35222333",
  "alias": "juan.perez",
  "roleId": 2,
  "isActive": true
}

### Baja lógica
DELETE {{DigitalArs.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
